        "collapsible_tab_W7etYx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Set includes a flat sheet, a fitted sheet, and 2 pillowcases (one pillowcase with Twin/Twin XL, two with Queen and King)</li><li>100% organic cotton</li><li>300 thread count, single-ply sateen weave<br/>Breezeline cooling weave that vents body heat</li><li>Deep pockets and reinforced elastic fit up to a 15\" mattress</li><li>Machine washable</li><li>Handcrafted in the USA</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 40,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 32,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_THr6Kx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Organic Cotton (from fields)—100% certified organic cotton in a pure cotton weave. It lets your skin breathe, balances moisture, and helps your body regulate temperature without chemical interference. No synthetic blends, dyes, or chemical treatments.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wP3yAA": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How it feels",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Crisp, smooth, and lightweight against the skin, with the clean hand of real cotton rather than a slick synthetic finish. The 300 thread count sateen weave feels soft and breathable, and the Breezeline structure vents heat instead of trapping it, so the surface stays cool through the night. It softens further with every wash.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_4LJNQb": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty & Returns",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Pillows may be returned within 30 days of delivery. Because the fill is adjustable and personal, we ask that the pillow and its protector are clean and undamaged. Stained or damaged items are not eligible for return. Confirm the current return window and any restocking fee at checkout.</p><p>Backed by Ultimate Snooze quality standards and handcrafted in the USA. For specific coverage terms on pillows, see our warranty page or contact support.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
